## VERDICT
First line of STATUS: `GATE VERDICT B535: b522 <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> round 1 of 2 on #101 @ af21095 (C1 delta <4 paths, 1 commit, +338 -10 by program y/n, one src file y/n, removed lines accounted <10 of 10> y/n, non-ASCII new bytes <n> - C2 existing edits <7 of 7 lines shown ruling-only y/n>, new names <24 y/n>, red at base <n of n predicted> right reason y/n, mutants <k of m killed, survivors names|none>, rows no mutant turns red <n>, controls c0 c1 c2 as expected y/n, unknown-section probe <unreachable|reachable> - C3 new strings <n distinct, n occurrences>, customer words changed <n> - C4 proposals compared <n>, with deal usage <n>, colour rows removed <n>, figures differing <n> - C5 build 0/0 <y/n>, Engine/Import/Api <n/n/n>, web <files/tests>, failed <n>, skipped <n>, names lost <n> added <n> - C6 live lanes sharing a path <n>, semantic overlap with B518 <read|not read>, conflict markers <n> - C7 checks <n completed success of n>, pending <names|none>, failing <names|none>, CodeQL open alerts on the PR ref <n>, analyses <n of 4> - C8 web consumers read <n>, new customer string <n>, gitleaks canary rc <n>, scan rc <n>)`. **A NO GO line ends with `majors+: B535-n, ...` naming every Major and Blocker by id.** Then: Step 0 sha256s and slot count with control / REFUSE counts with controls / PINS (start, mid, verdict, branch name beside each sha) / instrument and load (dotnet, node, npm versions; load and slot per heavy run; every wait; every `gh` GET named) / the prediction (written before any run, with its evidence path) / C1-C8 each with the FAIL (clock time), evidence path and result / the removed-lines table (10) / the existing-line table (7) / the new-names table (24: red or green at base, killing mutant) / the mutant table and the rows table / the literal-census table / the differential table / findings `B535-n` (severity, `path:line` at the head, instrument, FAIL met, fix-shape in prose, the regression that would be red, evidence class; "none" is valid